msgid "RTK technology can greatly improve the accuracy of positioning."
msgstr "RTK 技术可大幅提高定位精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-datagnss-gem1305-rtk.rst:104
#: 9032750a99804b5b8afae93d3f6ed0da
msgid ""
"RTK technology requires a base and a rover, with the base placed on the "
"ground, which is referred to as the rover on the drone.The data from the "
"base needs to be transmitted to the drone via telemetry radio and inputted "
"into the RTK receiver on the rover."
msgstr ""
"RTK 技术需要一个基站和一个流动站，基站放置在地面，流动站安装在无人机上。基站数据需通过数传无线电传输到无人机，并输入流动站上的 RTK 接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-datagnss-gem1305-rtk.rst:110
#: 65613184122b4967992039cf324c06b3
msgid "Base station setup"
msgstr "基站设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-datagnss-gem1305-rtk.rst:111
#: 83d4e8a0c0a04e0bb4d8010669dc51d7
msgid ""
"We suggest using the NANO RTK Receiver as the configuration for the base "
"station(ground base station), which is more convenient and user-friendly."
msgstr "建议使用 NANO RTK 接收机作为基站（地面基站），更方便易用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-datagnss-gem1305-rtk.rst:113
#: 5baa7a0879834813a1498fde13443b05
msgid ""
"Please refer to the following link for the full base station setup guide: - "
"`Base station setup <https://wiki.datagnss.com/index.php/Faq-how-to-setup-"
"base-or-rover>`__"
msgstr ""
"请参阅以下链接获取完整基站设置指南：- `基站设置 <https://wiki.datagnss.com/index.php/Faq-how-to-"
"setup-base-or-rover>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-datagnss-gem1305-rtk.rst:117
#: 0e35d9887d134d19b3961178ce834795
msgid "Rover station (Aircraft) setup"
msgstr "流动站（飞行器）设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-datagnss-gem1305-rtk.rst:118
#: 8022386b47dd4abf90ee8e20bd2c3376
msgid ""
"For vehicles, NANO RTK Receiver or GEM1305 can be chosen as the Rover for "
"RTK."
msgstr "飞行器可选用 NANO RTK 接收机或 GEM1305 作为 RTK 流动站。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-datagnss-gem1305-rtk.rst:120
#: 1ce7a7f8e08d444890306eb821bc2778
msgid ""
"Whether you choose NANO RTK Receiver or GEM1305, you need to confirm in the "
"Satrack software that all RTCM data outputs are disabled and all NMEA "
"outputs are enabled."
msgstr ""
"无论选择 NANO RTK 接收机还是 GEM1305，均需在 Satrack 软件中确认禁用所有 RTCM 数据输出并启用所有 NMEA 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-datagnss-gem1305-rtk.rst:122
#: 7596b5ba554a439bb0e0b4a995587daa
msgid "In Rover mode, the output rate must be set to 5Hz."
msgstr "流动站模式下，输出速率必须设置为 5Hz。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-datagnss-gem1305-rtk.rst:124
#: 96d825cfa97f4683be3e6e7a72545c7f
msgid ""
"Please refer to the following link for the full rover station setup guide: -"
" `Rover station setup <https://wiki.datagnss.com/index.php/Faq-how-to-setup-"
"base-or-rover>`__"
msgstr ""
"请参阅以下链接获取完整流动站设置指南：- `流动站设置 <https://wiki.datagnss.com/index.php/Faq-how-to-"
"setup-base-or-rover>`__"

